     "value": "Use the provided start image as the first frame and the provided end image as the final frame anchor. A before-and-after transformation of the loft with the camera completely still. Starting from the empty concrete room, the furniture appears piece by piece like a time-lapse: the jute rug unrolls across the floor, the oak sofa and its cushions slide into place facing the windows, the coffee table, the floor lamp and the sideboard appear, the olive trees grow up in their pots and the linen curtains fall from the top of the windows. The afternoon light stays the same throughout. Soft sounds of furniture being set down and a calm piano melody."
